    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PageIndex Workflow for Knowledge Base - Addition\n\n## Purpose\nMirrors a knowledge-base file addition from Pinecone into PageIndex so the chatbot's primary KB tool (PageIndex) stays in sync with the vector store. Runs as a sub-workflow right after the Pinecone embed succeeds.\n\n## How it works\n- Receives `fileId` + `fileName` from the caller\n- Copies the source Drive file as a temporary Google Doc (so .docx, .doc, etc. become convertible)\n- Exports the temporary Google Doc as PDF (PageIndex requires PDFs)\n- Multipart-uploads the PDF to the PageIndex `/doc/` endpoint\n- Extracts the returned `doc_id`, upserts a row in the PageIndex_File_Tracker sheet (status = active), and deletes the temporary Google Doc to leave Drive clean\n\n## Triggered by\nExecute Workflow trigger  invoked as a sub-workflow with `fileId` + `fileName`.\n\n## Called by\n- RAG Workflow for Knowledge Base - Addition\n\n## Reads/writes\n- Reads from and writes to Google Drive (creates a temp Google Doc copy, exports as PDF, then deletes the temp copy)\n- Calls the PageIndex API (uploads the new PDF doc)\n- Upserts Google Sheets `Customer_Support_Data`  `PageIndex_File_Tracker`",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview-doc",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1104,
        112
      ]
    }
